but how about the broken support?

262
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,536
That's a great idea.

263
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:02,457
We have to give something to our heroes,

264
00:15:02,540 --> 00:15:05,017
and that's a perfect
token of our appreciation.

265
00:15:05,100 --> 00:15:07,040
Please take it. We insist.

266
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:09,638
Thanks, but are you sure about that?

267
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:14,440
Alright, everybody!

268
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:17,837
Let's bring this gift to our
friends from the Blue Sea!

269
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:19,877
If we wrap it up, it'll
be easier to carry!

270
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,777
It's gonna take every
one of us to move it!

271
00:15:21,860 --> 00:15:23,331
Yeah, you're not kidding.

272
00:15:31,980 --> 00:15:33,680
Oh, come on Robin.

273
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:35,777
I can't wait too long.

274
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:37,320
I'm so hungry.

275
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:41,140
There's not a soul in sight.

276
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:43,397
I've got to admit, this is pretty weird.

277
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:47,127
Wonder where all those angels
and warriors ran off to and why.

278
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:49,800
Hey, be thankful they're gone. Trust me,

279
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:51,857
if they see us making a
run for it with all the

280
00:15:51,940 --> 00:15:53,777
loot we pulled from their
favorite giant snake,

281
00:15:53,860 --> 00:15:55,597
Well, they're not gonna be too thrilled.

282
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:58,757
Nami and Conis probably already
have the ship ready to sell by now,

283
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:00,757
so Robin better hurry
and get back here quick.

284
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:01,670
We gotta go.

285
00:16:01,753 --> 00:16:03,020
I'm hungry, Sanji.

286
00:16:03,140 --> 00:16:04,137
Got anything to eat?

287
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:06,161
Nope, all the food's on the ship.

288
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:09,077
We gotta have the whole
thing to munch on, right?

289
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:09,990
Come on.

290
00:16:10,073 --> 00:16:10,903
I've had enough.

291
00:16:10,986 --> 00:16:12,657
I'm tired of just sitting around.

292
00:16:12,740 --> 00:16:14,057
You guys can wait for her.

293
00:16:14,140 --> 00:16:15,357
I'm gonna go to the ship.

294
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:16,270
Alright!

295
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,390
Jack!

296
00:16:17,473 --> 00:16:18,303
What are you?

297
00:16:18,386 --> 00:16:23,103
Stupid head!

298
00:16:23,186 --> 00:16:26,172
I'll tell the guys they're all like
stupid before you have to go back here!

299
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:30,160
Hey, look! It's Robin!

300
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:32,940
Hi, hot stuff!

301
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:35,257
Hey! Robin!

302
00:16:35,340 --> 00:16:37,280
Hurry up! Run!

303
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:38,900
We gotta leave!

304
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:41,520
We stole some gold! Stop it!

305
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:43,080
Look, you moron!

306
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:45,120
Right behind her, see them?

307
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:46,514
They can hear you too!

308
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:48,360
Ah! It's an army!

309
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:54,120
No, no! Not good! Not good!

310
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:58,500
That big thing can only
be one thing! A cannon.

311
00:16:59,060 --> 00:16:59,890
A cannon!

312
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:03,428
Just our luck, they'd
all come back at once.

313
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:05,030
Robin!

314
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:06,360
Get the lid out!

315
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:08,500
We gotta get back to the ship now!

316
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:11,320
Check out this ghoul!

317
00:17:11,580 --> 00:17:14,286
I bet we found every
piece on the island, huh?

318
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:17,417
From here, it looks like they've
already packed their bags.

319
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:18,330
Oh, no!

320
00:17:18,460 --> 00:17:20,107
They're not leaving already!

321
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:22,800
Hold on you guys don't go.

322
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:24,880
Oh great. Here they come

323
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:30,340
Well, I guess it's up to
me to handle this one.

324
00:17:32,060 --> 00:17:32,977
Stop. Stop.

325
00:17:33,060 --> 00:17:34,880
You say like hell will stop.

326
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:41,394
We wish life and limb to come
to this island in the sky?

327
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:51,110
Capture them?

328
00:17:51,193 --> 00:17:52,057
What's he talking about?

329
00:17:52,140 --> 00:17:54,337
The only thing we're
trying to do is thank them!

330
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:56,126
Oh, Miss, is there a problem?

331
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:58,829
You and your friends
want this gold, right?

332
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:03,680
I guess we don't. What?

333
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:05,780
Please wait!

334
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,380
I can't turn around!

335
00:18:15,580 --> 00:18:17,417
I know they're chasing us!

336
00:18:17,500 --> 00:18:20,600
Zoro, did you see me take
care of him back there?

337
00:18:21,220 --> 00:18:22,500
You're not bad.

338
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:25,120
Hey, Robin!

339
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:26,560
Better hurry up!

340
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:29,160
Hey, Robin! Wait!

341
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,160
Don't stop!

342
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:33,980
Until we reach Cloudy!

343
00:18:35,580 --> 00:18:36,410
Bye!

344
00:18:42,580 --> 00:18:45,297
When you're lost and alone?

345
00:18:45,380 --> 00:18:50,697
I can always hear your voice
while you wander far from home!

346
00:18:50,780 --> 00:18:56,017
Gazing up at the sky, you
are just like the moon.

347
00:18:56,100 --> 00:19:00,680
You never change as you
climb into the night!

348
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:08,077
But your reflection waves when

349
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:11,937
you disappear fading so silently?

350
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:18,377
Stay as you are, don't lose your way!

351
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:21,620
Let these words guide you,

352
00:19:21,980 --> 00:19:25,580
don't ever look back!

353
00:19:27,620 --> 00:19:32,237
Don't give up on your
dreams, their endless nights!

354
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:36,277
They come to you again and again.

355
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:38,997
Until you see the journey through?

356
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:44,877
You may not turn, I hope that you learn!

357
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:50,380
To put your past behind,
and just keep moving on.
